SUMMARY:Indivisible Asheville WNC Bimonthly Meeting
DESCRIPTION:“Indivisible AVL bimonthly meetings are held on the 4th Thursday of the month in February\, April\, June\, August\, and October\, with an earlier date in December reserved for an informal end-of-year social gathering. Everyone is welcome at all of our events\, including and especially first-timers. So come learn what’s up with the resistance\, find opportunities to get involved\, and share your questions\, suggestions\, and ideas. And bring a friend!” \nMeeting Time: 6-7:30 PM {Set-up: 5-6 PM // Clean-up: 7:30-8 PM} \nIndivisible Asheville WNC is a partner organization via our UU the Vote group as part of our larger Justice Ministry. Meetings are held on the 4th Thursday of even-numbered months (except December).  \n 
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/indivisible-asheville-wnc-bimonthly-meeting/2026-08-27/
LOCATION:1 Sandburg Hall/Kitchen\, 1 Edwin Pl\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:*Justice Ministry - LIBERATION,Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://uuasheville.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Indivisible-Asheville-WNC-Bimonthly-Meeting-Image.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Carol Rovello":MAILTO:crovello55@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
